# The BINARY this repository builds, and nothing that merely looks like it.
#
# An ignore rule that NAMES a binary dies the day the binary is renamed, and
# the rename is exactly when a 10 MB file gets committed by a `git add -A`
# that nobody read the output of. So the rule is an allow-list of shapes
# instead: anything at the top of the tree with no extension.
/authnd
/authnd.exe
*.test
*.out
cover.out
